  "vv57:0.4": "935. 7. Dutiyakaraṇīyavimānavatthu ",
  "vv57:1.1": "‘‘Uccamidaṃ maṇithūṇaṃ vimānaṃ, ",
  "vv57:1.2": "samantato dvādasa yojanāni; ",
  "vv57:1.3": "Kūṭāgārā sattasatā uḷārā, ",
  "vv57:1.4": "veḷuriyathambhā rucakatthatā subhā. ",
  "vv57:2.1": "936. ‘‘Tatthacchasi pivasi khādasi ca, ",
  "vv57:2.2": "dibbā ca vīṇā pavadanti vagguṃ; ",
  "vv57:2.3": "Dibbā rasā kāmaguṇettha pañca, ",
  "vv57:2.4": "nāriyo ca naccanti suvaṇṇachannā. ",
  "vv57:3.1": "937. ‘‘Kena tetādiso vaṇṇo…pe… ",
  "vv57:3.2": "",
  "vv57:3.3": "vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv57:4.1": "939. So devaputto attamano…pe… ",
  "vv57:4.2": "",
  "vv57:4.3": "yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ. ",
  "vv57:5.1": "940. ‘‘Karaṇīyāni puññāni, ",
  "vv57:5.2": "paṇḍitena vijānatā; ",
  "vv57:5.3": "Sammaggatesu bhikkhūsu, ",
  "vv57:5.4": "yattha dinnaṃ mahapphalaṃ. ",
  "vv57:6.1": "941. ‘‘Atthāya vata me bhikkhu, ",
  "vv57:6.2": "araññā gāmamāgato; ",
  "vv57:6.3": "Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, ",
  "vv57:6.4": "tāvatiṃsūpago ahaṃ. ",
  "vv57:7.1": "942. ‘‘Tena metādiso vaṇṇo…pe… ",
  "vv57:7.2": "",
  "vv57:7.3": "Vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv57:8.1": "Dutiyakaraṇīyavimānaṃ sattamaṃ. "
}
